=== quit offer / 70 columns ===
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
press ^D again to quit

^D                  Confirm quitting
^C                  Cancel the quit offer
Escape              Cancel the offer and stop the turn
^/ or ^?            Close this reference and cancel the offer

^C cancels quitting · ^D quits
